=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg> <!-- -->1 min</span></div><h1>Jeu Concours Starwax 80 Ans : +10 000€ de Cadeaux, Robot KitchenAid, Kamado, Robot Aspirateur</h1><p class=\"article-subtitle\">Grand jeu Starwax 80 ans : plus de 10 000€ de cadeaux à gagner dont un robot KitchenAid, un kamado, un robot aspirateur et 300 cartes cadeaux.</p><div class=\"article-rating-bar\"><a href=\"https://jeux-concours.starwax.fr/80-ans-starwax/\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Participer au jeu concours<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"article-hero-image\" style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;max-height:450px\"><img alt=\"Jeu concours Starwax 80 ans 10000 euros de cadeaux 2026\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;max-height:450px\" src=\"/images/articles/jeu-concours-starwax-80-ans-10000-euros-cadeaux-2026.svg\"/></div><div class=\"ad-container \" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"><ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display:block\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5064203547863113\" data-ad-slot=\"1564426359\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins></div><div style=\"background:var(--surface, #fefce8);padding:1.25rem;border-radius:12px;margin:2rem 0\"><form style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flame\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--primary)\"><path d=\"M12 3q1 4 4 6.5t3 5.5a1 1 0 0 1-14 0 5 5 0 0 1 1-3 1 1 0 0 0 5 0c0-2-1.5-3-1.5-5q0-2 2.5-4\"></path></svg><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-right:8px\">Recevez les bons plans par email</span><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Votre email\" required=\"\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:180px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border, #e5e7eb);font-size:0.9rem\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--primary);color:white;font-weight:600;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.9rem\">OK</button></form></div><div class=\"article-content\"><div><p>\n<h2>Grand Jeu Starwax 80 Ans : +10 000€ de Cadeaux à Gagner !</h2><p><strong>Starwax</strong> fête ses <strong>80 ans</strong> et vous gâte avec un jeu concours exceptionnel : plus de <strong>10 000€ de cadeaux</strong> à remporter !</p><hr><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://jeux-concours.starwax.fr/80-ans-starwax/\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Participer au jeu concours <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Les 3 Lots Exceptionnels</h2><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Lot</th><th>Cadeau</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Lot 1</strong></td>\n<td>Robot aspirateur laveur haut de gamme</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Lot 2</strong></td>\n<td>Robot pâtissier <strong>KitchenAid</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Lot 3</strong></td>\n<td>Barbecue <strong>Kamado</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><hr><p><div id=\"ezoic-pub-ad-placeholder-203\" class=\"ad-container\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"></div><h2>300 Cartes Cadeaux</h2><p>En plus des 3 lots principaux, <strong>300 cartes cadeaux</strong> sont à gagner !</p><hr><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://jeux-concours.starwax.fr/80-ans-starwax/\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Participer au jeu concours <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Comment participer ?</h2><p>1. Rendez-vous sur la page du jeu concours Starwax\n2. Remplissez le formulaire de participation\n3. Tentez votre chance pour l'un des 303 lots</p><hr><h2>Infos pratiques</h2><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th><strong>Organisateur</strong></th><th>Starwax (80 ans)</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Valeur totale</strong></td>\n<td>+ de 10 000€</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Nombre de lots</strong></td>\n<td>3 lots exceptionnels + 300 cartes cadeaux</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Participation</strong></td>\n<td>Gratuite</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p>> 80 ans ça se fête — et avec plus de 300 lots, vous avez toutes vos chances !\n</p></div></div><div class=\"ad-container \" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"><ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display:block\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5064203547863113\" data-ad-slot=\"1564426359\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins></div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin:40px 0;padding:32px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF0F0 0%, #FFF8F0 100%);border-radius:16px;border:2px solid #FECDD3\"><p style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--foreground)\">Profiter de cette offre</p><a href=\"https://jeux-concours.starwax.fr/80-ans-starwax/\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" style=\"padding:14px 32px;font-size:1rem\">Participer au jeu concours<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></article><div class=\"ad-container \" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"><ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display:block\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5064203547863113\" data-ad-slot=\"1564426359\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins></div><section class=\"related-articles\"><h2>A lire aussi</h2><div class=\"articles-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr))\"><a href=\"/article/femme-actuelle-grand-jeu-voyage-decouverte-sejours-2026\" class=\"card\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div style=\"position:relative;height:160px;overflow:hidden\"><img alt=\"Femme Actuelle Grand Jeu Voyage et Decouverte sejours a gagner\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bot